overload without\n    worker_thread, documents deprecation of worker_thread in the 3-thread\n    overload, and updates g3doc/rtp_receive_flow.md to document the unified\n    network thread architecture.\n\n    Bug: webrtc:558821261\n    Change-Id: I0231a081d9b5700ae632cb50cb7534474d12a78f\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/499302\n    Reviewed-by: Fredrik Solenberg \u003csolenberg@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Commit-Queue: Tomas Gunnarsson \u003ctommi@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48676}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/README.mozilla.last-vendor", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/create_peerconnection_factory.cc", "third_party/libwebrtc/api/create_peerconnection_factory.h", "third_party/libwebrtc/g3doc/rtp_receive_flow.md"], "git_node": "cd10f7bf9e8508d19260c18960522f5213d84358", "git_parents": ["f5d9035d8489edde0bd078a9c601eb0759401c34"], "node": "564e226a40c25fcde4afce0a8103b6e9a8cf8469", "parents": ["eeb9f2e1ac796536fe05019b9ff012b9b05a04f1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077266 - Vendor libwebrtc from d275cd1108\n\nUpstream commit: https://webrtc.googlesource.com/src/+/d275cd110816e519a648b0551494caddcba9e254\n    Protect Android TurnCustomizer and CallSessionFileRotatingLogSink against double-free.\n\n    Adopt NativeLifecycleLock in TurnCustomizer and CallSessionFileRotatingLogSink\n    to synchronize native pointer access and ensure dispose() is thread-safe and\n    idempotent when called concurrently.\n\n    Bug: b/533453798\n    Change-Id: I09d15be0c53f887abf793f20dd5937ad3303e8ff\n    Reviewed-on: https://webrtc-review.googlesource.com/c/src/+/504720\n    Commit-Queue: Linus Nilsson \u003clnilsson@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Sergey Silkin \u003cssilkin@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Reviewed-by: Zo\u00e9 Lepaul \u003czlep@webrtc.org\u003e\n    Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#48677}\n", "files": ["third_party/libwebrtc/RE