b6f42a6ed27d2933b", "parents": ["9078e0704d506f98d0806489d2659676468bb964"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2023167 - Part 5: Track WASM tail call scratch registers on LA and RV. r=profiler-reviewers,mstange\n\n* WasmTailCallFPScratchReg: `t3` on RV and `$t3` on LA.\n* WasmTailCallRAScratchReg: `ra` on RV and `$ra` on LA.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D296695\n", "files": ["mozglue/baseprofiler/core/platform-linux-android.cpp", "mozglue/baseprofiler/core/platform.cpp", "tools/profiler/core/platform-linux-android.cpp", "tools/profiler/core/platform.cpp"], "git_node": "a1160356bba7322e1c10c3cc5647d39ebc802250", "git_parents": ["5d458763323d769cd8d3314d8805841c13f5a0fc"], "node": "144527eaa51bd6e1909543b9f79d85f84d9e6e3d", "parents": ["42b7f67542d2550e775f5c3b6f42a6ed27d2933b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2023167 - Part 6: Implement RV64 and LA64 frame chasing fallback. r=profiler-reviewers,mstange\n\nThis considers both the frame layout defined by JS ABI and the\nplatform-native ABI.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D294883\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/lul/LulMain.cpp", "tools/profiler/tests/gtest/LulTest.cpp"], "git_node": "6699b0755601f405667a09f1279859621a7fe340", "git_parents": ["a1160356bba7322e1c10c3cc5647d39ebc802250"], "node": "6c2cca3ee59ef8ce88c381f306e520edb9414a43", "parents": ["144527eaa51bd6e1909543b9f79d85f84d9e6e3d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rong Bao \u003cwebmaster@csmantle.top\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2023167 - Part 7: Add support for DwarfCFIToModule::UndefinedRule. r=mstange\n\nThis adds support for undefining calculation rule for a given (address,\nreg) pair.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D297845\n", "files": ["tools/profiler/lul/LulDwarf.cpp", "tools/profiler/lul/LulDwarfSummariser.cpp", "tools/profiler/lul/LulDwarfSummariser.h"], "git_node": "c3760a0afbc2c5a2601494eb953964d33919bee0", "git_parents": ["6699b0755601f405667a09f1279859621a7fe340"], "node": "79c0376ef206aa6a2c667177e2a797c2277cfc2f", "parents": ["6c2cca3ee59ef8ce88c381f306e520edb9414a43"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076596 - Type-check tab.mjs. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,jswinarton\n\nObject.hasOwn replaces the `in` check on _lastAccessed, which tsc narrows to never; nothing on the tab's prototype chain defines _lastAccessed, so the two agree.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329851\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tab.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/tsconfig.json"], "git_node": "cb349984c95d19d0a8ec1355948d4ab6e9e13363", "git_parents": ["c3760a0afbc2c5a2601494eb953964d33919bee0"], "node": "3d782243874ddd08d01f701851d7f039ea9e89ca", "parents": ["79c0376ef206aa6a2c667177e2a797c2277cfc2f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076547 - Cancel a pending tab group preview when keyboard focus leaves the group label. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,jswinarton\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329856\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/test/browser/tabs/browser_tab_groups_keyboard_focus.js"], "git_node": "151a358e6a94ab8e04df9b5482a7d724cd964d14", "git_parents": ["cb349984c95d19d0a8ec1355948d4ab6e9e13363"], "node": "f81113f02327b1ae9e764543d02c10dc5dae70d8", "parents": ["3d782243874ddd08d01f701851d7f039ea9e89ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "KS \u003ckshampur@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2045799 - Run macOS aarch64 AWSY pageload tests on tart VMs. r=aglavic,perftest-reviewers,mozperftest-reviewers\n\nThis patch adds the awsy, awsy-dmd, and awsy-tp6 tests to the macOS Tart\nVM pool on macOS 15 aarch64, similar to how linux and windows AWSY\nalready runs on VMs\n\nFor now they also keep running on the hardware so that both can be\ncompared for ~2 weeks before the hardware variants are removed in a\nfollow up.\n\nawsy-base tests are not moved to VMs. Presently it seems that the\ncurrent 8gb allocation is not enough. macOS compresses the idle Fx pages\nduring the test which seems to be causing base content resident unique\nmemory bimodal.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332037\n", "files": ["python/mozperftest/mozperftest/perfdocs/hardware.yml", "taskcluster/test_configs/test-platforms.yml", "taskcluster/test_configs/test-sets.yml", "testing/perfdocs/generated/awsy.md", "testing/perfdocs/generated/performance-infrastructure.md"], "git_node": "16a9ce427251b02d804c9f2cd1d1aaf0812829d0", "git_parents": ["151a358e6a94ab8e04df9b5482a7d724cd964d14"], "node": "f275f6c017e9da972345fd16e06b9fc7aabf4d55", "parents": ["f81113f02327b1ae9e764543d02c10dc5dae70d8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings tld-suffixes mobile-experiments ct-logs - r=release-managers,RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332170\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/raw/initial_experiments.json", "netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/translations-models.json"], "git_node": "486fad58d0f906417aafd68c572a53789f6ef6fa", "git_parents": ["16a9ce427251b02d804c9f2cd1d1aaf0812829d0"], "node": "4ec46d9dd1f36070cf129d05257d31f834be105f", "parents": ["f275f6c017e9da972345fd16e06b9fc7aabf4d55"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079528 - Fix an unchecked cast warning and make warnings fatal in the remaining Gradle plugins. r=ahochheiden\n\nThe config, dependencies, publicsuffixlist and apksize included builds now set allWarningsAsErrors like the\nconventions, apilint and nimbus-gradle-plugin builds already do.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331835\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/plugins/config/build.gradle.kts", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/build.gradle.kts", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/dependencies/src/main/java/DependenciesPlugin.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/plugins/publicsuffixlist/build.gradle.kts", "mobile/android/fenix/plugins/apksize/build.gradle.kts"], "git_node": "03102d5b94694568785a47456c3d3a7397e74e7e", "git_parents": ["486fad58d0f906417aafd68c572a53789f6ef6fa"], "node": "f82c39f945ed96809abb2a8ab4ce70871e30a5a1", "parents": ["4ec46d9dd1f36070cf129d05257d31f834be105f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003crvandermeulen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077804 - Add the blank line docutils needs before the list in the `unreferenced_depends` docstring. r=bustage\n", "files": ["python/mozbuild/mozbuild/configure/lint.py"], "git_node": "6c42417f189309bfe9ee4447fdf849e0602c157a", "git_parents": ["03102d5b94694568785a47456c3d3a7397e74e7e"], "node": "f1dd51aeaaae23664a696445b26ed965d1f26cf7", "parents": ["f82c39f945ed96809abb2a8ab4ce70871e30a5a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "unifolia \u003cjlewis@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069543 - Add the AITab footer gradient and \"Made with Smart Window\" lockup r=fluent-reviewers,mlucks,bolsson\n\nhttps://www.figma.com/design/sIgXsbSFZjKIcfErMoBgLr/Smart-Window-Q3?node-id=16774-24478&m=dev\n\nFooter for AI Tab. Note that feedback (thumbs up/down) is not ready for dev yet and out of scope for this patch.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.servi