nd `nss-rs` that needed work-arounds in D312427.\n\nThis changes some Rust APIs to accept NSS types rather than raw bytes.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317415\n", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/noise/src/ec.rs", "security/manager/ssl/noise/src/handshake/initiator.rs", "security/manager/ssl/noise/src/handshake/mod.rs", "security/manager/ssl/noise/src/handshake/responder.rs", "security/manager/ssl/noise/src/handshake/service.rs", "security/manager/ssl/noise/tests/handshake.rs"], "git_node": "483e8859c25fac93e115fe9b8ca84749820acde2", "git_parents": ["c0ca82ca9beb823ae933a014457c373089e0b863"], "node": "8bb5892bac35384272ba106e36a0f313cce0473b", "parents": ["e94ca265726c2f139a720dabaeb974cf513592d5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1613369 - Use paired nearest alpha rounding and correct conversion expectations. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman,places-reviewers,mak\" for causing failures at conformance-alpha-premultiplied-reftest.html.\n\nThis reverts commit 20c63b43b9ba3aa5a9f3c4c9b2289aa10b865c4f.\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/test/mochitest.toml", "dom/canvas/test/reftest/color_quads.list", "dom/canvas/test/test_canvas.html", "dom/canvas/test/test_canvas_png_roundtrip.html", "gfx/2d/Swizzle.cpp", "gfx/2d/SwizzleGeneric.h", "gfx/2d/SwizzleNEON.h", "gfx/tests/gtest/TestSwizzle.cpp", "image/test/unit/image1.webp", "image/test/unit/image1png16x16.jpg", "image/test/unit/image1png64x64.jpg", "image/test/unit/image1quality50.webp", "image/test/unit/test_imgtools.js", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/compositing/2d.composite.grid.no_filter.no_shadow.drawImage.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/compositing/2d.composite.grid.no_filter.no_shadow.fillRect.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/compositing/2d.composite.grid.no_filter.no_shadow.pattern.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/canvas/element/