 "ee203168e091087fb3ea8f1a6907c1b5c3f891fe", "parents": ["8bb5892bac35384272ba106e36a0f313cce0473b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078642 - Document debugging and logging the address bar. r=urlbar-reviewers,adw DONTBUILD\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332011\n", "files": ["browser/components/urlbar/docs/debugging.md", "browser/components/urlbar/docs/testing.md"], "git_node": "6ec7fb537d7df22c97b357c2ac7a04850a9c3adc", "git_parents": ["bc58d78989b91bb36263714035e01b20e3360094"], "node": "ff51a54d29385929b3778079999085f991f57d2f", "parents": ["ee203168e091087fb3ea8f1a6907c1b5c3f891fe"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jari Jalkanen \u003cjjalkanen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2069097: Fix excess dirty-origin writes at startup. r=ArnaudBienner\n\nAfter a build-ID change, dirty shutdown, or migration, scanned origin\nmetadata often has a stale mLastAccessTime from .metadata-v2 that\ndiffers from the DB row. This caused cacheRowMatches=false and an\nunnecessary dirty-queue push for origins whose usage was otherwise\nidentical.\n\nReconcile timestamps before comparing, replace the mOriginUsage\u003e0\nguard with aDirectoryExists, add an mUsageModificationDisabled guard,\nand re-enable that flag after RemoveQuota in the full-scan path.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327351\n", "files": ["dom/quota/ActorsParent.cpp", "dom/quota/CommonMetadata.h"], "git_node": "54e4f79368e5050ba88ef2a4298f520590e31005", "git_parents": ["6ec7fb537d7df22c97b357c2ac7a04850a9c3adc"], "node": "b395cb03cac224e53f1ff1437f4c5a229db463a0", "parents": ["ff51a54d29385929b3778079999085f991f57d2f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078754 - Give the blocked site warning page a dark color scheme so its secondary button gets light text. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,kcochrane,Itiel\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331277\n", "files": ["browser/themes/shared/blockedSite.css"], "git_node": "f8974c27f101f648217cd1337e2d2b960686f610", "git_parents": ["54e4f79368e5050ba88ef2a4298f520590e31005"], "node": "d987e76af54317f5ea62d885c6f62f4c51d80058", "parents": ["b395cb03cac224e53f1ff1437f4c5a229db463a0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079985 - Disable layout.reflow.synthMouseMove on pointerevent_coordinates_when_locked.html; r=smaug,masayuki\n\nSee bug 2079980 for the details.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332229\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/pointerevents/pointerlock/pointerevent_coordinates_when_locked.html.ini"], "git_node": "702fee251634d284e5d632184cb4a2ec63c991c1", "git_parents": ["f8974c27f101f648217cd1337e2d2b960686f610"], "node": "018dee3e57aadeef996ccf613298a34502622c17", "parents": ["d987e76af54317f5ea62d885c6f62f4c51d80058"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076596 - Correct the JSDoc types of getInferenceOptions, getAccuracyStats and computeRandScore. r=ai-platform-reviewers,nordzilla\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329864\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/ml/actors/MLEngineParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/ml/content/ClusterAlgos.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "61926a0075faec4bf30cf1c92f6fdcef82ad7d25", "git_parents": ["702fee251634d284e5d632184cb4a2ec63c991c1"], "node": "28891bad4bdcf5a5f75f4209d0cd6b9695663031", "parents": ["018dee3e57aadeef996ccf613298a34502622c17"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076596 - Type-check SmartTabGrouping.sys.mjs. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,niklas\n\ngetInferenceOptions returns a bare `{ runtimeFilename }` when no Remote Settings record matches, so the two telemetry reads of `modelRevision` narrow with `in`; they record the same value as before.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329865\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/SmartTabGrouping.sys.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/tsconfig.json"], "git_node": "433d37a7f16468bc5f3bb7a294ea9a58b0cd2c24", "git_parents": ["61926a0075faec4bf30cf1c92f6fdcef82ad7d25"], "node": "8f3ef66f7215ea743f283c144aea3e08713d9416", "parents": ["28891bad4bdcf5a5f75f4209d0cd6b9695663031"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1877510 - Let Enter in the edit bookmark folder tree save the bookmark. r=mak,places-reviewers\n\nRight and Left arrows still expand and collapse folders. The Bookmark Properties dialog shares the tree, so Enter there now accepts the dialog too.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330007\n", "files": ["browser/components/places/content/editBookmark.js", "browser/components/places/content/places-tree.js", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_addBookmarkForFrame.js", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_bookmark_popup.js"], "git_node": "31b3fcd5388758eb1297da57f34abce200a67402", "git_parents": ["433d37a7f16468bc5f3bb7a294ea9a58b0cd2c24"], "node": "d304c8040802a97724c18ac1fa65d0bb282c96a4", "parents": ["8f3ef66f7215ea743f283c144aea3e08713d9416"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1877510 - Add an access key to the bookmark panel's Save button. r=mak,fluent-reviewers,places-reviewers,flod\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330008\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/main-popupset.inc.xhtml", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_bookmark_popup.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/browser.ftl"], "git_node": "6f9e2ef0e91a7c6578a7816e9edef305f9ffa539", "git_parents": ["31b3fcd5388758eb1297da57f34abce200a67402"], "node": "4a9c5e7830089972458655bc7389b19c564cb6a9", "parents": ["d304c8040802a97724c18ac1fa65d0bb282c96a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan Varga \u003cjvarga@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2074009 - Use isDefaultBrowserAsync() in ASRouter targeting and onboarding; r=omc-reviewers,mviar\n\nUse the asynchronous default-browser check for the cached and uncached ASRouter\ntargeting attributes and when selecting the onboarding upgrade message.\n\nTogether with the preceding migrations, this removes default-browser checks as\na source of potential UI stalls during startup.\n\nUpdate the related tests to stub the asynchronous API. Retain synchronous stubs\nwhere needed for trainhop tests running against Beta and Release builds.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D330323\n", "files": ["browser/components/aboutwelcome/tests/browser/browser_aboutwelcome_screen_targeting.js", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/ASRouterTargeting.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/modules/OnboardingMessageProvider.sys.mjs", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/browser/browser_asrouter_newtab_messages.js", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/browser/browser_asrouter_targeting.js", "browser/components/asrouter/tests/unit/unit-entry.js"], "git_node": "31d8d21a8dce972b5035bdd12cd38429e00fcf1a", "git_parents": ["6f9e2ef0e91a7c6578a7816e9edef305f9ffa539"], "node": "9d49f22d6e72709b1bf9380fe7d3e1c3a2438ce1", "parents": ["4a9c5e7830089972458655bc7389b19c564cb6a9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078981. r=layout-reviewers,dshin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332254\n", "files": ["layout/generic/TextOverflow.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/text-overflow-root-textarea-crash.xhtml"], "git_node": "6272e5372f6132fa52d0dcaa6dc6680ac5c6fbcc", "git_parents": ["31d8d21a8dce972b5035bdd12cd38429e00fcf1a"], "nod