ion: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332190\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsIFrame.cpp", "layout/svg/SVGObserverUtils.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/text/crashtests/unicode-bidi-crash.html"], "git_node": "d0950615e81b77637ec7eed02b75daa6a35efc4e", "git_parents": ["1083b53d8dbadbf3a5bb68bb11ab7d8c75517bc5"], "node": "08f7b72877aa189970871ee527f66943743768c8", "parents": ["ccd2a94390256fc0d264e872dc4b2c07e94a48a1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 1972522 - Use view transitions for sidebar animations r=emilio,nsharpley,desktop-theme-reviewers,sidebar-reviewers\" for causing failures at browser_backOrSidebarButtonFitts.js.\n\nThis reverts commit eaf49e7f4b6a1989d4a77d50721f4c00a701cb8b.\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/components/genai/tests/browser/browser_chat_sidebar.js", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_bookmarks_close_panel.js", "browser/components/sidebar/browser-sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/sidebar-main.css", "browser/components/sidebar/sidebar-main.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/sidebar-panel-header.mjs", "browser/components/sidebar/sidebar-pins-promo.css", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_a11y_sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_f11_fullscreen_sidebar.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/browser_sidebar_animation.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/browser/legacy/browser_sidebar_keys.js", "browser/components/sidebar/tests/marionette/test_last_used_sidebar_panel.py", "browser/themes/shared/sidebar.css", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tabs.css", "toolkit/content/tests/browser/browser_bug1693577.js"], "git_node": "6dfa03bf91400b7b9a8ac6f3633c17c83a0ba6d3", "git_parents": ["d0950615e81b77637ec7eed02b75daa6a35efc4e"], "node": "87d3accea729ae0c7a41f155a03bd4b3aa83fd87", "parents": ["08f7b72877aa189970871ee527f66943743768c8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079365: Change WPT content-visibility-auto-svg-image.html to just use a colorful square, to avoid fuzzy failures from text-antialiasing-in-img subtlety. r=jfkthame\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331669\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-contain/content-visibility/content-visibility-auto-svg-image.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-contain/content-visibility/content-visibility-auto-svg-image-ref.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-contain/content-visibility/content-visibility-auto-svg-image.html"], "git_node": "14eeff9d47e57b8587cc43384c557c06dee5ae0a", "git_parents": ["6dfa03bf91400b7b9a8ac6f3633c17c83a0ba6d3"], "node": "b835626b212b5e96c6cea51b87889d83fbca13ca", "parents": ["87d3accea729ae0c7a41f155a03bd4b3aa83fd87"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andrew McCreight \u003ccontinuation@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079343 - Improve the BUG_COMPONENTs in third_party. r=glandium DONTBUILD\n\n* Rust library upgrades are often filed in Core:: General, so that seems like\n  a better default for those than Firefox Build System :: General.\n* The webkit/ directory includes only includes performance tests, so move it\n  to the testing component.\n* picosha2 and simde are used only for wasm2c, which is used for RLBox, so use\n  that component for those.\n* xsimd uses Core :: Performance: General because that matches the component\n  specified in the Updatebot definition in third_party/xsimd/moz.yaml.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331651\n", "files": ["third_party/moz.build"], "git_node": "5530fbe1991e5ce4bf9aea6bf6ab5581007615af", "git_parents": ["14eeff9d47e57b8587cc43384c557c06dee5ae0a"], "node": "7582a0b27ef9f95aab721246c20a48ef00774fc6", "parents": ["b835626b212b5e96c6cea51b87889d83fbca13ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080076 - Add render blocking and view transition tests. r=smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332309\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/resources/pageswap-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html"], "git_node": "2469e358f8427da80a0d60014fa950cdc3b7df76", "git_parents": ["5530fbe1991e5ce4bf9aea6bf6ab5581007615af"], "node": "ab542e442a6f71237f1e0e4985242bf2df238aea", "parents": ["7582a0b27ef9f95aab721246c20a48ef00774fc6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076983. r=layout-reviewers,dshin\n\nLow-risk fix. More principled fix in bug 2080219.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332437\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsGridContainerFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-grid/observer-chain-crash.html"], "git_node": "b585040adde788099d085bd0f5fb93b1a3eeaa2e", "git_parents": ["2469e358f8427da80a0d60014fa950cdc3b7df76"], "node": "ca321d56acd32ae3a8b1318e4c24c726e78f7b83", "parents": ["ab542e442a6f71237f1e0e4985242bf2df238aea"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2076983. r=layout-reviewers,dshin\" for causing bustages in nsGridContainerFrame.cpp.\n\nThis reverts commit b585040adde788099d085bd0f5fb93b1a3eeaa2e.\n", "files": ["layout/generic/nsGridContainerFrame.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-grid/observer-chain-crash.html"], "git_node": "17806667f08fe0a9f1eaa4aa23b8b4434c61f6d8", "git_parents": ["b585040adde788099d085bd0f5fb93b1a3eeaa2e"], "node": "3ece758d9999adb9bdb73fc5bcdd134f87f189a3", "parents": ["ca321d56acd32ae3a8b1318e4c24c726e78f7b83"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2080076 - Add render blocking and view transition tests. r=smaug\" for causing failures at element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html?nested.\n\nThis reverts commit 2469e358f8427da80a0d60014fa950cdc3b7df76.\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/resources/pageswap-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html"], "git_node": "4a614c3c38a363a5e82e5109930c2da96ec722d4", "git_parents": ["17806667f08fe0a9f1eaa4aa23b8b4434c61f6d8"], "node": "2faef4f565b15599d178605e9a9d5a5c4f6fbf3b", "parents": ["3ece758d9999adb9bdb73fc5bcdd134f87f189a3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2079733 - Move always_underline_links to StyleAdjuster. r=layout-reviewers,jfkthame\" for causing failures complaining about testAlwaysUnderlineLinks.\n\nThis reverts commit eab940c23bd18551165b95e782d57875819a5a98.\n", "files": ["layout/base/nsPresContext.cpp", "layout/reftests/text-decoration/always-underline-links-line-through-ref.html", "layout/reftests/text-decoration/always-underline-links-line-through.html", "layout/reftests/text-decoration/reftest.list", "layout/style/res/ua.css", "servo/components/style/style_adjuster.rs", "servo/components/style/values/specified/text.rs", "xpcom/ds/StaticAtoms.py"], "git_node": "52d552093da4ec6c3fef2c12f777b34bf9544d1f", "git_parents": ["4a614c3c38a363a5e82e5109930c2da96ec722d4"], "node": "9f8cbc5276e0c75661f8b55ccdce2f0b4c5dd96f", "parents": ["2faef4f565b15599d178605e9a9d5a5c4f6fbf3b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2079147 - Implement layer invalidation via cascade data diffing. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\" for causing failures at layer-insert-rule-invalidation.html.\n\nThis reverts commit edb43fe8c6d34d7896ca90fe0d0254ac6f3e6d5f.\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/invalidation/stylesheets.rs", "servo/components/style/stylist.rs", "testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/css/layer-insert-rule-invalidation.html"], "git_node": "de871519ff28de7d1c29766017e176606991fe92", "git_parents": ["52d552093da4ec6c3fef2c12f777b34bf9544d1f"], "node": "c93eb4a4e3338844400b905fc4e8d141d95050a4", "parents": ["9f8cbc5276e0c75661f8b55ccdce2f0b4c5dd96f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079819 - Rasterize border corners at their exact scale under a static transform. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nNormalBorderData::update rounded the raster scale of border segments to a\npower of two. That avoids re-rasterizing the corner textures every frame while\na scale animates, but under a static transform it rasterizes the corners at a\ndifferent size than the one they are composited at, and the resampling blurs\ntheir edges. A circle under the 0.1 scale of a viewBox had its corners drawn\nat 0.125 and shrunk by 0.8 with bilinear filtering, which is what made\nsvg/geometry/reftests/circle-002.svg differ from its reference by up to 55 on\nthe circle's edge once SVG circles are drawn as WebRender borders.\n\nOnly round the scale when the primitive's spatial node or one of its ancestors\nhas an animated transform or is being pinch-zoomed, and use the exact scale\notherwise. The MAX_BORDER_RESOLUTION cap still applies.\n\nThis affects every border under a static scale that is not a power of two, not\nonly the ones SVG shapes push.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332090\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/prim_store/borders.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/border-radius-static-downscale-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/border-radius-static-downscale.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/border/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/transforms/border-scale-3.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/transforms/border-scale-4.png", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/transforms/border-scale.png"], "git_node": "7d66c5e0b99243ac134faf94c185f273a6a2c072", "git_parents": ["de871519ff28de7d1c29766017e176606991fe92"], "node": "22a2117257f21a48f88f86b4a6d24127c3c1d744", "parents": ["c93eb4a4e3338844400b905fc4e8d141d95050a4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079198 - Use the search-tabs icon for the list all tabs button in horizontal tab mode on Windows. r=desktop-theme-reviewers,tabbrowser-reviewers,kcochrane\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332284\n", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/parent/ext-tabs.js", "browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_tabs_hide.js", "browser/themes/shared/addons/extension-controlled.css", "browser/themes/shared/tabbrowser/tabs.css"], "git_node": "fec7b4d4bb6ed8e9157bb5d5657ec16d2c29e2e5", "git_parents": ["7d66c5e0b99243ac134faf94c185f273a6a2c072"], "node": "0d5f750319cf4f568ada03aa047933e217212da6", "parents": ["22a2117257f21a48f88f86b4a6d24127c3c1d744"], "tags": []}, {"author": "calu \u003ccalu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2064878 - Add Listen to Page telemetry playback, speed, and voice controls r=android-reviewers,moyin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331404\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenAction.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenMiddleware.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ListenReducer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ui/PlaybackControls.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/java/mozilla/components/feature/listentopage/ui/PlayerCompact.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/