ulien Cristau \u003cjcristau@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080178 - set SOURCE_DATE_EPOCH in tasks that generate a sbom. r=sylvestre,firefox-build-system-reviewers\n\ngenerate_sbom reads this and not MOZ_BUILD_DATE; for reproducibility\nwe want it to use a predictable timestamp.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332413\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/build/android-stuff.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/android.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/kind.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/linux.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/macosx.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/windows.yml"], "git_node": "e6adbbf7a9239fbfea8693c3e53d188e5e780784", "git_parents": ["049995944f744e5b7bee5c049c53d43872d348da"], "node": "299cba918b72b41919b813dde03b8fff8d1416ff", "parents": ["f87a8fe143a1f2eb2b6d1897932d64b759d07e39"], "tags": []}, {"author": "longsonr \u003clongsonr@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079709 r=emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332265\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.h", "dom/base/nsDataDocumentContentPolicy.cpp"], "git_node": "84a086f1499ddb1a188c603ce52d50aa61e28da2", "git_parents": ["e6adbbf7a9239fbfea8693c3e53d188e5e780784"], "node": "43f87325d6b393b6e5231a4b37b47b039ef3af3d", "parents": ["299cba918b72b41919b813dde03b8fff8d1416ff"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079939 - Turn off all New Tab widgets in automation with one pref r=webdriver-reviewers,reemhamz,jdescottes\n\nSets browser.newtabpage.activity-stream.widgets.enabled to false in the test profiles, the Marionette client and RecommendedPreferences, so no widget renders or fetches in automation unless a test turns widgets back on. This replaces the  per-widget Picture of the Day pref in the test profiles.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332204\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/test/browser/browser_customize_menu_content.js", "remote/shared/RecommendedPreferences.sys.mjs", "testing/marionette/client/marionette_driver/geckoinstance.py", "testing/profiles/common/user.js", "testing/profiles/xpcshell/user.js"], "git_node": "c67f4ad799346954ea5eba32087176cdf9a0519b", "git_parents": ["84a086f1499ddb1a188c603ce52d50aa61e28da2"], "node": "64ad03575078433d1ca1785fe7a1d6f296faf565", "parents": ["43f87325d6b393b6e5231a4b37b47b039ef3af3d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Maxx Crawford \u003cmcrawford@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078974 - Turn on widget market gating with every widget off by default r=reemhamz\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331453\n", "files": ["browser/app/profile/firefox.js", "browser/extensions/newtab/lib/ActivityStream.sys.mjs", "browser/extensions/newtab/test/jest/lib/ActivityStream.test.js"], "git_node": "e56a450baf3ed20b8f6f0f1e17d58730f57d6693", "git_parents": ["c67f4ad799346954ea5eba32087176cdf9a0519b"], "node": "79f19f8541167c54f0e69e65275816cbfe378e73", "parents": ["64ad03575078433d1ca1785fe7a1d6f296faf565"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tyler Etchart \u003ctetchart@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079400 - Removed deprecated/flaky test_Tools_GetPageContent.js test r=gregtatum\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332208\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_Tools_GetPageContent.js"], "git_node": "5c5479f4d3a249be122f776cb279fb4dd2569e61", "git_parents": ["e56a450baf3ed20b8f6f0f1e17d58730f57d6693"], "node": "e7cea5cb3331fbfb29d8c61eedcad2395fceb4a7", "parents": ["79f19f8541167c54f0e69e65275816cbfe378e73"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080146 - Disable navigation rate limit in test_text-fragments-create-text-directive.html. r=dom-core-reviewers,avandolder\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332450\n", "files": ["dom/base/test/test_text-fragments-create-text-directive.html"], "git_node": "8594011759a0e331c65a71afefec4af09fff01c8", "git_parents": ["5c5479f4d3a249be122f776cb279fb4dd2569e61"], "node": "748070580d2c62342c5def0110dfda19c810e5cc", "parents": ["e7cea5cb3331fbfb29d8c61eedcad2395fceb4a7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Niklas Jaeschke \u003cjjaschke@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080190 - Keep waiting for frame construction across refreshes without re-registering the observer. r=avandolder\n\nWhen frame construction was still pending after a refresh, the post-refresh\nobserver registered a new observer from within its own callback. The refresh\ndriver visits observers appended during dispatch, so this looped forever\nwithin a single tick. Keep the existing observer registered instead.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332442\n", "files": ["dom/base/SpeculationRules.cpp", "dom/base/SpeculationRules.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/speculation-rules/prefetch/document-rules-pending-stylesheet.https.html"], "git_node": "5dbd982341e5aa05bd248723810ca36b0b737793", "git_parents": ["8594011759a0e331c65a71afefec4af09fff01c8"], "node": "c91b4ccf1ac4a4f4d96c1c8588d05805869e5998", "parents": ["748070580d2c62342c5def0110dfda19c810e5cc"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ed Lee \u003cedilee@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080033 - add yahoo scout chatbot configuration to allow nimbus rollout r=yjamora,fluent-reviewers,bolsson\n\nadd config and assets, update providers ahead of rollout\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332266\n", "files": ["browser/components/genai/GenAI.sys.mjs", "browser/components/genai/assets/brands/scout.svg", "browser/components/genai/chat.css", "browser/components/genai/tests/browser/browser_chat_sidebar.js", "browser/locales/en-US/browser/genai.ftl"], "git_node": "983c9bdc1767c1376ab97a5c2813f9651a299364", "git_parents": ["5dbd982341e5aa05bd248723810ca36b0b737793"], "node": "e6b133fd0bd53dceab829fe0947594b63c1d4372", "parents": ["c91b4ccf1ac4a4f4d96c1c8588d05805869e5998"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csledru@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075144 - Publish the SBOM alongside the other release artifacts r=releng-reviewers,taskgraph-reviewers,jcristau\n\nThe universal mac tasks generate no SBOM of their own, so they re-upload the\ntwo per-architecture ones as sbom-x86_64.json and sbom-aarch64.json rather than\nmerging them.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332102\n", "files": ["taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/manifests/firefox_candidates.yml", "taskcluster/gecko_taskgraph/manifests/firefox_nightly.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/build/macosx.yml", "taskcluster/scripts/misc/unify.sh"], "git_node": "6cd9fb3ad5bc8745dc1903823e85de33523212ce", "git_parents": ["983c9bdc1767c1376ab97a5c2813f9651a299364"], "node": "4de79afd63c393e1fc228b540a919cd3c69e75f4", "parents": ["e6b133fd0bd53dceab829fe0947594b63c1d4372"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Atila Butkovits \u003cabutkovits@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2079400 - Removed deprecated/flaky test_Tools_GetPageContent.js test r=gregtatum\" for causing build bustages.\n\nThis reverts commit 5c5479f4d3a249be122f776cb279fb4dd2569e61.\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/xpcshell/test_Tools_GetPageContent.js"], "git_node": "27062fc327987b68026b86a0e10483751b55ca94", "git_parents": ["6cd9fb3ad5bc8745dc1903823e85de33523212ce"], "node": "6bbdc6fcd0b94dbc1fd16176abac18211ad077f8", "parents": ["4de79afd63c393e1fc228b540a919cd3c69e75f4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Silaghi \u003casilaghi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2074123 - show recording notification for custom tabs as well as regular tabs. r=android-reviewers,mcarare\" for causing RecordingDevicesMiddlewareTest\n\nThis reverts commit 049995944f744e5b7bee5c049c53d438