iceError` documents how each variant is meant to surface to content:\n\n- `UnsupportedFeature` \u2192 `TypeError`\n- `FailedLimit` \u2192 `OperationError`\n\nWe previously flattened all variants to a string and rejected unconditionally with `OperationError`, but it didn't matter, because:\n\n- `Adapter::RequestDevice` already validates `requiredFeatures` in the content process and rejects with a `TypeError` before any IPC.\n- Unknown feature strings fail `GPUFeatureName` enum conversion in the bindings earlier still.\n\nSo, no behavior changes here, just converging with upstream with some bonus defense-in-depth for correctness.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331512\n", "files": ["dom/webgpu/ipc/WebGPUChild.cpp", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/client.rs", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/error.rs", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/lib.rs", "gfx/wgpu_bindings/src/server.rs"], "git_node": "4a52dc59b7fb52f8abf1b0a538edec6ac22034fd", "git_parents": ["1e350e87969deaf679ff5db35cd43bf533bc90bb"], "node": "5c1fdad88b1d9a3cedb8871d1bf8bd9ab3446c12", "parents": ["01a89415f2c50d1442811beeae5cc67aa629b410"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077631: apply code formatting via Lando\n\n# ignore-this-changeset\n", "files": ["dom/webgpu/ipc/WebGPUChild.cpp"], "git_node": "2431d5ea8cff7875745ae061082887d81dd3e87c", "git_parents": ["4a52dc59b7fb52f8abf1b0a538edec6ac22034fd"], "node": "3d5c44085f1a1bdb8b903632c30cb15e6ef7064f", "parents": ["5c1fdad88b1d9a3cedb8871d1bf8bd9ab3446c12"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Iain Ireland \u003ciireland@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078745: Check needsNegativeZeroCheck in MToNumberInt32::congruentTo r=spidermonkey-reviewers,jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332173\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/ion/bug2078745.js", "js/src/jit/MIR.h"], "git_node": "3c434cc293c494f7afb611156ccc73a1747a60ef", "git_parents": ["