 "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076013 - Clamp MAX_UNIFORM_BLOCK_SIZE to 64 KiB. r=ahale\n\nThis avoids excessive memory usage on certain websites on Linux with AMD hardware.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331063\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGL2ContextState.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLTypes.h", "dom/canvas/test/webgl-mochitest/test_webgl2_uniform_block.html"], "git_node": "3235279f9094e9edbad8f6f92d62741fc58401b9", "git_parents": ["a5af6890489742353f223083480273499af9f1da"], "node": "8d5166509f4fd33cd0224e9c44127442f5a0d090", "parents": ["33309992dbe74cf72c3bcf26ee844894bb3291b4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2045457 - Make ToStringPolicy box all operand types not handled by lowering. r=spidermonkey-reviewers,iain\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332452\n", "files": ["js/src/jit-test/tests/warp/bug2045457.js", "js/src/jit/TypePolicy.cpp"], "git_node": "b94af77aaca754c8c288553bbb4b796c508ad865", "git_parents": ["3235279f9094e9edbad8f6f92d62741fc58401b9"], "node": "6f5fbf4fa98af5a4031484f37ba0b81e53d82727", "parents": ["8d5166509f4fd33cd0224e9c44127442f5a0d090"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076596 - Type-check tabs.mjs. r=tabbrowser-reviewers,jsudiaman\n\nThe `appendChild` and `insertBefore` overrides now return the inserted node, as `Node`'s do; no caller reads the result.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D329858\n", "files": ["browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tab-hover-preview.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabs.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/content/tabsplitview.mjs", "browser/components/tabbrowser/tsconfig.json", "browser/components/tabbrowser/types/elements.ts"], "git_node": "f5fc73cfd2337774e30e0b07eab038dc18fc729f", "git_parents"