41e959f27e0b853af\nnb-NO -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nne-NP -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nnl -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nnn-NO -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\noc -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\npa-IN -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\npl -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\npt-BR -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\npt-PT -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nrm -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nro -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nru -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nsk -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nsl -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nson -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nsq -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nsr -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nsv-SE -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nta -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nte -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nth -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\ntl -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\ntr -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\ntrs -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nuk -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nur -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nuz -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nvi -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nwo -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nxh -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nzam -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nzh-CN -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\nzh-TW -\u003e e279fc5d2063b75f1aa42f141e959f27e0b853af\n", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": "33e00200b1eb83c716f2d2923b03b6b986953251", "git_parents": ["becc2d99021818b861a690f31e33b186872a3270"], "node": "13e9395fb009d54b459075cc56e5935fc0436407", "parents": ["37e81a3be2d657d1ba5bf50291c225c6ea6b80d0"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080319 - Preserve font file path from UnscaledFontDWrite::CreateFromFontDescriptor. r=lsalzman\n\nSo that they survive record+replay properly.\n\nI found this while debugging why some PDFs were larger / slower with\nSkGDI vs. Cairo, and this is what was going on:\n\n * Content records system fonts like Arial by descriptor (path).\n * PrintTranslator replays that in the parent through\n   UnscaledFontDWrite::CreateFromFontDescriptor, which creates the font\n   with mFont = nullptr, and no path (this is what the assign() call in\n   this patch fixes).\n * When the parent re-records into our DrawTargetRecording,\n   GetFontDescriptor bails out on !mFont, so Arial gets serialized as\n   RecordedFontData instead (the whole font file).\n * Replaying that in the parent goes through OTS, since\n   RecordedFontData::PlayEvent sanitizes when XRE_IsParentProcess(), and\n   that causes the check that goes from GDI font to LOGFONT to fail,\n   because of a different fontDirectionHint that OTS puts in.\n\nThus the fonts were painted as outlines rather than using the faster\nnative GDI calls.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332551\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/ScaledFontDWrite.cpp"], "git_node": "aebd2b6b2419e1208296a76bce10a84196259195", "git_parents": ["33e00200b1eb83c716f2d2923b03b6b986953251"], "node": "3d7d111337add2ac0595a67fcfeb0299287ec5a2", "parents": ["13e9395fb009d54b459075cc56e5935fc0436407"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": [], "git_node": "a0bec9103543e29ff7138140135e9b11dad94408", "git_parents": ["aebd2b6b2419e1208296a76bce10a84196259195", "54145f37844018dee93406811dcdeeba00689022"], "node": "f52f116343e6c1935aaa8573a7098d21ec6dac09", "parents": ["3d7d111337add2ac0595a67fcfeb0299287ec5a2", "c555ff05d3aa671c7574d35066fc75b27e0fe001"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mark Banner \u003cstandard8@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066160 - Flush sharedData when overriding SERP telemetry providers in tests to avoid intermittent missing impressions. r=search-reviewers,daleharvey\n\nWithout a flush the provider info only reaches content processes on idle, so a\nSERP loaded before then is not recognised and its impression is never reported.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331528\n", "files": ["browser/components/search/SearchSERPTelemetry.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "fb3913af09f2c234b6e0d71b0056eb2d336a9047", "git_parents": ["a0bec9103543e29ff7138140135e9b11dad94408"], "node": "5b4e51afaef9640fe79b714aae6a2ffaf118dc7b", "parents": ["f52f116343e6c1935aaa8573a7098d21ec6dac09"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Daniel Holbert \u003cdholbert@cs.stanford.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079768 - Guard against null mURI when logging in gfxUserFontEntry::LoadPlatformFont. r=jfkthame\n\nA FontFace built from an ArrayBuffer is a buffer source with no URI, so the\nLOG() statements must not dereference mSrcList[aSrcIndex].mURI unconditionally.\n\nNote: there are only three `SourceType` enum values (eSourceType_Local,\neSourceType_URL, eSourceType_Buffer); and eSourceType_Local never reaches this\nLoadPlatformFont function.  So, our logging is justified in assuming that a null\nmURI implies that we're eSourceType_Buffer -- hence the \"(buffer)\" label.\n\nI've added an assertion at the start of the function to validate this\nassumption.\n\nNote, the included WPT has a .ini file to enable logging, so that the test\ndoes actually exercise this logging code (in Firefox) and does serve as a\nregression-test.  (It crashes when run in the WPT harness in a build without\nthe fix.)\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332590\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxUserFontSet.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-font-loading/fontface-from-arraybuffer-crash.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-font-loading/fontface-from-arraybuffer-crash.html"], "git_node": "3ba521c5ec5674ab7426e7bf755372aa91c53454", "git_parents": ["fb3913af09f2c234b6e0d71b0056eb2d336a9047"], "node": "f7963917ba10a89fb6f66060952982ad7da517e5", "parents": ["5b4e51afaef9640fe79b714aae6a2ffaf118dc7b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Andreas Farre \u003cfarre@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080076 - Add render blocking and view transition tests. r=smaug\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332309\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/outbound-transition-ready-after-pagehide.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/pageswap-after-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-view-transitions/navigation/resources/pageswap-media-change.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-form-stack-removal.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-insert-named-anchor.html", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/render-blocking/element-render-blocking-top-of-document.html"], "git_node": "b11c172c5ebcfea723cbff41154b37654daf983d", "git_parents": ["3ba521c5ec5674ab7426e7bf755372aa91c53454"], "node": "6ba74b11e3faa0b656ee9b7b2b830287cdbeabe6", "parents": ["f7963917ba10a89fb6f66060952982ad7da517e5"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sajid Anwar \u003csajidanwar94@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073201 - Fix intermittent random-computed.tentative.html failures by increasing iterations for math-depth property. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332699\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-values/random-computed.tentative.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-values/random-computed.tentative.html"], "git_node": "1498edfe85a3c5cdc4f1dfaa5b626c301b37a0c1", "git_parents": ["b11c172c5ebcfea723cbff41154b37654daf983d"], "node": "c811ff3b64ab73c0b4069c5ef770273354d24d2b", "parents": ["6ba74b11e3faa0b656ee9b7b2b830287cdbeabe6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\naf -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nan -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nar -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nast -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\naz -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbe -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbg -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbn -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbo -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbqi -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbr -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbrx -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nbs -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nca -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nca-valencia -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\ncak -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\nckb -\u003e ae1a4c840d2d02255c0c2adefb00a4f35d54188e\ncs 