o.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge autoland to mozilla-central\n", "files": [], "git_node": "8e9ac3e12bbaf39d4c282dc8849221aa17d4f714", "git_parents": ["aecd8c74f1220ec35c6c15627a23c1ec9ab0d05a", "d08667e9e223d4a626c2256aabb4c17a9ee4e47d"], "node": "1a0832246d36398fd7fd5acfa11f5f7a517d0537", "parents": ["bb234c0905b55721c4bbf93d6163c901c0f971b9", "6b6447b5e9f8e55ccdffbc2685992a892fec194d"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791754519, "git_changesets": ["becc2d99021818b861a690f31e33b186872a3270", "33e00200b1eb83c716f2d2923b03b6b986953251", "aebd2b6b2419e1208296a76bce10a84196259195", "a0bec9103543e29ff7138140135e9b11dad94408", "fb3913af09f2c234b6e0d71b0056eb2d336a9047", "3ba521c5ec5674ab7426e7bf755372aa91c53454", "b11c172c5ebcfea723cbff41154b37654daf983d", "1498edfe85a3c5cdc4f1dfaa5b626c301b37a0c1", "328ed2bb8eac42caf914ba1e0d224be2efeaf84e", "8fe39b600a831d12dbbe2ce7843f50329378bbd3", "d08667e9e223d4a626c2256aabb4c17a9ee4e47d", "8e9ac3e12bbaf39d4c282dc8849221aa17d4f714"], "user": "sstanca@mozilla.com"}, "45537": {"changesets": [{"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079934 - Install meson 1.1.0 in the wrench distrobox. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nThe osmesa-src upgrade needs meson \u003e= 1.1, but Debian 12 only ships\n1.0.1. Install the version install-meson.sh pins for CI instead.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332188\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/ci-scripts/distrobox.ini"], "git_node": "9c3e3aa842c45f21e084a4b47de3624d08ac33ca", "git_parents": ["d08667e9e223d4a626c2256aabb4c17a9ee4e47d"], "node": "54fee2affc2b1a7c1e85eb0cb1a4187e70d50e2a", "parents": ["6b6447b5e9f8e55ccdffbc2685992a892fec194d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077649 - Snap picture cache slice roots to the device pixel grid. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nA slice is rasterized relative to its spatial node and composited at a whole\ndevice pixel offset. When an unsnapped reference frame leaves a slice root at\na fractional offset, surfaces drawn into the slice that rasterize relative to\nroot land off the slice's pixel grid and get resampled when composited,\nblurring their content. Record slice roots during scene building and snap\nslice root scroll and sticky frames in the spatial tree, carrying the\nadjustment to their descendants, so the spatial tree agrees with where the\nslice is composited.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332180\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/spatial_node.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/spatial_tree.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/2077649-mask-fractional-scroll-root-ref.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/2077649-mask-fractional-scroll-root.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/mask/reftest.list"], "git_node": "96f8fc118cebd671972ecffc6a6f75193082cd2e", "git_parents": ["9c3e3aa842c45f21e084a4b47de3624d08ac33ca"], "node": "515d86c7416918d83f2128ca1608611f3c0ee9e7", "parents": ["54fee2affc2b1a7c1e85eb0cb1a4187e70d50e2a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Oriol Brufau \u003cobrufau@igalia.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080629 - Remove `style::logical_geometry::Direction`. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,emilio\n\n`style::logical_geometry::LogicalAxis` can be used instead.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332745\n", "files": ["servo/components/style/logical_geometry.rs"], "git_node": "f8885b7ae6941d1caf46c3cfd6e151d761cc0fb2", "git_parents": ["96f8fc118cebd671972ecffc6a6f75193082cd2e"], "node": "8fe07f2013298c440fc2f5e487b4dbabe9bf680c", "parents": ["515d86c7416918d83f2128ca1608611f3c0ee9e7"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079209 - Make \"loaded as image\" part of the stylesheet cache key. r=firefox-style-system-reviewers,layout-reviewers,boris\n\nSince it determines whether subresources should load.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332249\n", "files": ["layout/style/Loader.cpp", "layout/style/Loader.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/as-image/external-resource-data-url-sheet-helper.sub.svg", "testing/web-platform/tests/svg/as-image/external-resource-data-url-sheet.sub.html"], "git_node": "ee6eaa5a9b93b8ac4340924834e5609b731300c0", "git_parents": ["f8885b7ae6941d1caf46c3cfd6e151d761cc0fb2"], "node": "489d176bffa2a6314f69841482b081555edd3d46", "parents": ["8fe07f2013298c440fc2f5e487b4dbabe9bf680c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079470 - Skia GDI back-end. r=lsalzman\n\nThis works very similar to Cairo, in the sense that it records the page,\nanalyzes and decides what to rasterize vs. provide commands for.\ndrawPage() is where the meat of the approach is, the rest is translation\nto GDI commands.\n\nIn order to avoid pulling SkPicture as a dependency in a way that\ncomplicates our borrowed SkImage optimizations (see D331792), we pass an\nstd::function around to Skia that gets called every time we need to\nanalyze / rasterize the page, and PrintTargetWindows is what takes care\nof keeping the recordings around.\n\nIn my testing, in terms of quality, this tends to perform better than\nCairo, because Cairo has full-page rasterization fallback more often.\n\nI've also profiled this with the single-page HTML spec, and some\nmiscellaneous pages like `mixed.html` (attached to the bug), and this is\nfaster in all cases (with the fix for bug 2080319).\n\nThe InlineTranslator changes are so that we can reuse registered\nresources from previous pages (like fonts etc). It's not perfect,\nbecause each replay of a given page doesn't reuse the state / resources\nof the first pass of that very same page, which seems like it'd be\ndesirable. However it does allow for reusing resources across pages\nwhich is where most of the wins are in practice, so I think it's good\nenough. I'm open to better approaches there, but I'd rather land it and\niterate on it as needed, because this is in a state already better than\nCairo.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332556\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/InlineTranslator.cpp", "gfx/2d/InlineTranslator.h", "gfx/skia/gdi/SkGDIDocument.cpp", "gfx/skia/gdi/SkGDIDocument.h", "gfx/skia/generate_mozbuild.py", "gfx/skia/moz.build", "gfx/thebes/PrintTargetWindows.cpp", "gfx/thebes/PrintTargetWindows.h", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-015-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-019-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-022-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-024-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-025-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-027-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-028-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-029-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/monolithic-overflow-031-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/page-background-001-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/page-background-002-print.html.ini", "testing/web-platform/meta/css/css-page/page-background-003-print.html.ini"], "git_node": "404967219134df5562783409025a00434f9a9ac8", "git_parents": ["ee6eaa5a9b93b8ac4340924834e5609b731300c0"], "node": "1045f7d12b3e0886c067702af78f31b438e42dbf", "parents": ["489d176bffa2a6314f69841482b081555edd3d46"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079473 - Remove leftover prepare state, and pass a backdrop-filter chain's placement node to add_prim. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nPrepare no longer reads a picture's primitive list, so it doesn't need to take\nit out of the picture and restore it. PictureState::map_local_to_pic is never\nread. The placement node of a backdrop-filter chain is an argument of add_prim\nrather than a field set around one call.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331770\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/frame_builder.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/picture.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/prepare.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/scene_building.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/tile_cache/slice_builder.rs"], "git_node": "23f82d4713215e8cba445ebb439a590b07bfddad", "git_parents": ["404967219134df5562783409025a00434f9a9ac8"], "node": "9feaf8684244f4807379f6cb33b36a22c41b0ab4", "parents": ["1045f7d12b3e0886c067702af78f31b438e42dbf"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-central repo-update remote-settings ct-logs - r=release-managers,RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332752\n", "files": ["security/ct/CTKnownLogs.h", "security/manager/tools/log_list.json", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons-bloomfilters.json", "services/settings/dumps/main/devtools-compatibility-browsers.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/onecrl.json"], "git_node": "16b5853d727769b48d37c92cc41e1dc2968a059f", "git_parents": ["23f82d4713215e8cba445ebb439a590b07bfddad"], "node": "6cb06c951f26c4ee974f40898dac6247fe5b41c1", "parents": ["9feaf8684244f4807379f6cb33b36a22c41b0ab4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lando \u003clando@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Merge mozilla-central to autoland\n", "files": [], "git_node": "46866893673b1720392683222feb171f95a24986", "git_parents": ["16b5853d727769b48d37c92cc41e1dc2968a059f", "8e9ac3e12bbaf39d4c282dc8849221aa17d4f714"], "node": "fd9e7c8c8c5f20bb26f81220f813a597755d1f6e", "parents": ["6cb06c951f26c4ee974f40898dac6247fe5b41c1", "1a0832246d36398fd7fd5acfa11f5f7a517d0537"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Import translations from https://github.com/mozilla-l10n/android-l10n CLOSED TREE\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/res/values-tg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/android-components/components/feature/listentopage/src/main/res/values-tg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-is/strings.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/values-tg/strings.xml", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/main/res/values-hu/strings.xml"], "git_node": "78fce6c1ff45d0dbc84b4561aadc58292bb6362d", "git_parents": ["46866893673b1720392683222feb171f95a24986"], "node": "589c7cc54f4bce6e3280cdca2ddb971ec9af4263", "parents": ["fd9e7c8c8c5f20bb26f81220f813a597755d1f6e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Cornelius Emase \u003ccorneliuslochipi@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073439 - Move emitBailoutOOL and bailoutIf into CodeGeneratorShared r=jandem\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331028\n", "files": ["js/src/jit/arm/CodeGenerator-arm.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm/CodeGenerator-arm.h", "js/src/jit/arm64/CodeGenerator-arm64.cpp", "js/src/jit/arm64/CodeGenerator-arm64.h", "js/src/jit/shared/CodeGenerator-shared.cpp", "js/src/jit/shared/CodeGenerator-shared.h", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/CodeGenerator-x86-shared.cpp", "js/src/jit/x86-shared/CodeGenerator-x86-shared.h"], "git_node": "1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b", "git_parents": ["78fce6c1ff45d0dbc84b4561aadc58292bb6362d"], "node": "8c502b6a3d5781387469ac24e566948341e269ec", "parents": ["589c7cc54f4bce6e3280cdca2ddb971ec9af4263"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791796785, "git_changesets": ["9c3e3aa842c45f21e084a4b47de3624d08ac33ca", "96f8fc118cebd671972ecffc6a6f75193082cd2e", "f8885b7ae6941d1caf46c3cfd6e151d761cc0fb2", "ee6eaa5a9b93b8ac4340924834e5609b731300c0", "404967219134df5562783409025a00434f9a9ac8", "23f82d4713215e8cba445ebb439a590b07bfddad", "16b5853d727769b48d37c92cc41e1dc2968a059f", "46866893673b1720392683222feb171f95a24986", "78fce6c1ff45d0dbc84b4561aadc58292bb6362d", "1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b"], "user": "asilaghi@mozilla.com"}, "45538": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c0c03f3f899017ae4b7e56c0713f1ada51173c41 with DEVEDITION_159_0b1_BUILD2 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "5051aa1a06c1f206f6a1dfb80bc37f9371708d71", "git_parents": ["031c489c41faffa6cf06d3195b299de066c7fa77"], "node": "b88dc0f0fddf9e62cefdcc4cdab9ef9f752c108a", "parents": ["8517fde08bcb47cbff5267f8378a330a67cf670e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791812640, "git_changesets": ["5051aa1a06c1f206f6a1dfb80bc37f9371708d71"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45539": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c0c03f3f899017ae4b7e56c0713f1ada51173c41 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_159_0b1_BUILD2 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "1693f237df4f8597270f2dff31b2eee0dc56864b", "git_parents": ["5051aa1a06c1f206f6a1dfb80bc37f9371708d71"], "node": "a10c98b44920555a5d3d55e11c28ebbe917be927", "parents": ["b88dc0f0fddf9e62cefdcc4cdab9ef9f752c108a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791812704, "git_changesets": ["1693f237df4f8597270f2dff31b2eee0dc56864b"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45540": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c0c03f3f899017ae4b7e56c0713f1ada51173c41 with FIREFOX_159_0b1_BUILD2 a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "4dd2ece39fa16b622429347540ada382f5eaea59", "git_parents": ["1693f237df4f8597270f2dff31b2eee0dc56864b"], "node": "f0ab1b9f82ad1935e5e4c92313f3949ee1c9bec9", "parents": ["a10c98b44920555a5d3d55e11c28ebbe917be927"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791812973, "git_changesets": ["4dd2ece39fa16b622429347540ada382f5eaea59"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45541": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging c0c03f3f899017ae4b7e56c0713f1ada51173c41 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_159_0b1_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "537ec6a88f3c78a7bb84a552a565367b50654463", "git_parents": ["4dd2ece39fa16b622429347540ada382f5eaea59"], "node": "2c39fc65c7aa69ac95db61225c65f687ed9078d3", "parents": ["f0ab1b9f82ad1935e5e4c92313f3949ee1c9bec9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791814861, "git_changesets": ["537ec6a88f3c78a7bb84a552a565367b50654463"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45542": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@lando.moz.tools\u003e", "branch": "tags-unified", "desc": "No bug - Tagging eb9a6e3a736802c8e080a76c44dc81f409d99d54 with FIREFOX-ANDROID_158_0_RELEASE a=tagging CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": "5be826c462f6496c23cbd9c0f6b74b9cb867d505", "git_parents": ["537ec6a88f3c78a7bb84a552a565367b50654463"], "node": "183aea2022483de58e63903b8b36a42d15b8f2a7", "parents": ["2c39fc65c7aa69ac95db61225c65f687ed9078d3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791815090, "git_changesets": ["5be826c462f6496c23cbd9c0f6b74b9cb867d505"], "user": "ffxbld@lando.moz.tools"}, "45543": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mark Hammond \u003cmhammond@skippinet.com.au\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2076243 - Remove firstSync 'wipe' actions. r=skhamis,sync-reviewers,frontend-codestyle-reviewers\n\nDesktop allows a \"firstSync\" pref to take some actions before it syncs\nfor the first time. It's from over a decade ago when we had a dialog\nwhich asked the user how they wanted this device treated, optionally\nwiping the local client or the server. It's unused outside of tests.\n\nThis bug removes the \"wipe\" actions from this preference. It still leaves\nbehind a \"not ready\" state and a \"reset client\" state, as both are used\ninternally and by tests. We could remove them too, but the focus here is\navoiding unnecessary server wipes in a smallish easy to review patch.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331472\n", "files": ["services/sync/modules/stages/enginesync.sys.mjs", "services/sync/tests/tps/.eslintrc.mjs", "services/sync/tests/tps/all_tests.json", "services/sync/tests/tps/test_addon_wipe.js", "services/sync/tests/tps/test_bug530717.js", "services/sync/tests/tps/test_bug562515.js", "services/sync/tests/tps/test_client_wipe.js", "services/sync/tests/tps/test_history_collision.js", "services/sync/tests/unit/test_errorhandler_2.js", "services/sync/tests/unit/test_syncscheduler.js", "services/sync/tps/extensions/tps/resource/tps.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "c94ba4f19be18a769c0ca47dfad1905d371b9fe1", "git_parents": ["1a097ed8d31f6b307a5d0ebc34a82ceaf7f3727b"], "node": "0874263f3c76e3f9c63f721f23a3e4cf5dd81527", "parents": ["8c502b6a3d5781387469ac24e566948341e269ec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Release Engineering Landoscript \u003crelease+landoscript@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug - Bumping Firefox l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD CLOSED TREE\n\nach -\u003e df903cd8e583615b0ec353dc788b911fea61efed\naf -\u003e df903cd8e583615b0ec353dc788b911fea61efed\nan -\u003e df903cd8e583615b0ec353dc788b911fea61efed\nar -\u003e df903cd8e583615b0ec353dc788b911fea61efed\nast -\u003e