": "Sylvestre Ledru \u003csylvestre@debian.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2075334 - Show upstream's COPYING for HarfBuzz on about:license r=gfx-reviewers,nical DONTBUILD\n\nThe hand-kept holder list had not followed upstream since 2010 and missed\nmost of the current holders. Upstream's COPYING lists them and is refreshed\nwith every update.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332097\n", "files": ["gfx/harfbuzz/src/moz.build", "gfx/moz.build", "toolkit/content/licenses/harfbuzz.txt", "toolkit/content/licenses/moz.build"], "git_node": "5a99ceac42c3649d5016fa43cccac5c5b0d92c71", "git_parents": ["63cb2e05e2a038aca90128360f1b85ef6f9b76f8"], "node": "05e98fc865d86800aba1539a119a7cf3ef67734e", "parents": ["15bc3a298130d50055183489551516ecdfe8b349"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Neeco Fabian \u003cneecofabian@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2078877 - Persist dismissed HNT card stack cards across new tabs r=emcminn,omc-reviewers\n\n- Note: Preloading causes 1 tab delay in updates, set browser.newtab.preload = false to bypass\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331346\n", "files": ["browser/components/asrouter/modules/PanelTestProvider.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "b45fc4e808e9492876ee2cc6cf0939b11562b1d8", "git_parents": ["5a99ceac42c3649d5016fa43cccac5c5b0d92c71"], "node": "8a8a34cc637f32ccf5447be023e6ec3b64b2813f", "parents": ["05e98fc865d86800aba1539a119a7cf3ef67734e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Seva Alipov \u003csalipov@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080119: Suppress line end marker when using `text-overflow` and `line-clamp: no-ellipsis` on the same line. r=layout-reviewers,emilio\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333282\n", "files": ["layout/generic/TextOverflow.h", "testing/web-platform/tests/css/css-overflow/line-clamp/line-clamp-with-text-overflow-string-010-crash.html"], "git_node": "a4468087346878f9707118f05f43756cbbcd9