est to match the manual test.\n\nBoth the \"legacy\" and \"efficiency\" UI tests successfully passed 25x on Firebase. https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&landoInstance=lando-prod-2025&landoCommitID=104033\nAll \"legacy\" and \"efficiency\" UI tests successfully passed 1x on Firebase. https://treeherder.mozilla.org/jobs?repo=try&landoInstance=lando-prod-2025&landoCommitID=102107\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331592\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/MediaNotificationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/pageObjects/TabDrawerPage.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/selectors/TabDrawerSelectors.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/efficiency/tests/MediaNotificationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/robots/TabDrawerRobot.kt"], "git_node": "22a1883695082ee89774ed502e38db731974da94", "git_parents": ["cfef21c3ebfc2ab6bf61a61ede64b2c10c5f7e79"], "node": "e602841b9f5db3c7f2845bf30ea2865d38517537", "parents": ["3e592da213ccc9e8a2b51d1aaefae97b01dd7d9c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081216 - Use the temp dir as scratch space in xpcom unit tests, r=xpcom-reviewers,mccr8.\n\ntest_bug476919.js now passes on Android, so its fail-if annotation is removed.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333297\n", "files": ["xpcom/tests/unit/test_bug476919.js", "xpcom/tests/unit/test_iniParser.js", "xpcom/tests/unit/test_nsIProcess.js", "xpcom/tests/unit/test_symlinks.js", "xpcom/tests/unit/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "c942bea5d462f966ba23d86230582da91fed107f", "git_parents": ["22a1883695082ee89774ed502e38db731974da94"], "node": "0e2b58de7d14fd000e9caee88d3366f3a5d3d027", "parents": ["e602841b9f5db3c7f2845bf30ea2865d38517537"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081216 - Write the DMD test's output files to the temp dir, r=mccr8.\n\nSmokeDMD wrote its JSON output to the current directory, which is the test directory, and dmd.py fixes the stacks of its input files in place, rewriting the checked-in script-*.json files. Pass SmokeDMD an output directory, and give dmd.py copies of the input files in the temp dir.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333305\n", "files": ["memory/replace/dmd/test/SmokeDMD.cpp", "memory/replace/dmd/test/test_dmd.js"], "git_node": "420161ffa2b115616af9193b3f882481e4756c7e", "git_parents": ["c942bea5d462f966ba23d86230582da91fed107f"], "node": "adc64516ecabc8fea0bf588f0fc2b13c4a95a75d", "parents": ["0e2b58de7d14fd000e9caee88d3366f3a5d3d027"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Florian Qu\u00e8ze \u003cflorian@queze.net\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081216 - Copy the unicode-named jsctypes test library to the temp dir, r=firefox-desktop-core-reviewers ,mconley.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333302\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/ctypes/tests/unit/test_jsctypes.js"], "git_node": "135bbf9b0ffdb2b94a371b903daf6c76abe6a853", "git_parents": ["420161ffa2b115616af9193b3f882481e4756c7e"], "node": "ba1a2ebae48e4cea5414f790280d8b924dac0608", "parents": ["adc64516ecabc8fea0bf588f0fc2b13c4a95a75d"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Emilio Cobos \u00c1lvarez \u003cemilio@crisal.io\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080889 - Force autofill not to respect field-sizing: content. r=layout-reviewers,firefox-style-system-reviewers,dshin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333324\n", "files": ["layout/reftests/forms/input/text/autofill-preview-field-sizing.html", "layout/reftests/forms/input/text/reftest.list", "layout/reftests/forms/select/autofill-preview-blank.html", "layout/reftests/forms