ttps://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333018\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/FenixApplication.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/widget/SearchWidgets.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/widget/glance/SearchBarWidgets.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/gecko/search/SearchWidgetProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/FenixApplicationTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/widget/SearchWidgetProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "3d5c71b38c0135f5cead89d8b96a577c5923e77a", "git_parents": ["fe3236168f116428d827d85781710616b1c2b043"], "node": "3d73a47c3243b8474f1aa1d59644ef858dc18f94", "parents": ["695187d29a0e781c54df571fc2df8dd2ab74a555"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2055405 part 8: Fix outline titles now that glyph source text is provided to SkPDF. r=gfx-reviewers,accessibility-platform-reviewers,lsalzman,eeejay\" for causing mochitest failures @ browser_artifacts.js\n\nThis reverts commit eecd30d8e7e2b8b7a2d9e3815957650649c39745.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 7: Plumb glyph source text from content processes to the parent process via DrawTargetRecording. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit 268ef93f4a44a5489779e302f15a21f844a4af62.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 6: Feed per-glyph source text into GlyphBuffer when drawing text. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit 8347bcc75b493d3d1ac36b1f326e5e05f10e4f8c.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 5: Add a way for gfxTextRun::PropertyProvider to supply per-character source text. r=layout-reviewers,emilio\"\n\nThis reverts commit 568491dafb4da7bb1d564fc83d14847f6765de43.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 4: Add glyph source text support to Moz2D and the Skia backend. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit ed9e04a238a43ccf417d1410a6ddd663907efdd1.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 3: Don't associate nsMathMLChar with an accessibility node if the character is implicitly drawn for the element (e.g. square root). r=layout-reviewers,accessibility-platform-reviewers,dshin,eeejay\"\n\nThis reverts commit e9d47b7670ce7b8e2d906069755f20b5c7ac9464.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 2: PdfStructTreeBuilder: Map MathML to PDF. r=accessibility-platform-reviewers,eeejay\"\n\nThis reverts commit 331ce59001582e5ff8324c495bc00c340aa26cc9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2055405 part 1: SkPDF: Support specifying namespace for structure elements. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\"\n\nThis reverts commit 16620648ab11592dccd1513f309439d75f99c6f0.\n", "files": ["accessible/pdf/PdfStructTreeBuilder.cpp", "accessible/pdf/PdfStructTreeBuilder.h", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/browser.toml", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/browser_artifacts.js", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/browser_sourceText.js", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/browser_structTree.js", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/generate_pdfTest_font.py", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/head.js", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/pdfTest.ttf", "accessible/tests/browser/pdfOutput/pdfTest.ttf^headers^", "gfx/2d/2D.h", "gfx/2d/DrawEventRecorder.h", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetRecording.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetRecording.h", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.cpp", "gfx/2d/DrawTargetSkia.h", "gfx/2d/Factory.cpp", "gfx/2d/RecordedEventImpl.h", "gfx/ipc/CrossProcessPaint.cpp", "gfx/skia/skia/include/docs/SkPDFDocument.h", "gfx/skia/skia/src/pdf/SkPDFTag.cpp", "gfx/skia/skia/src/pdf/SkPDFTag.h", "gfx/thebes/PrintTargetSkPDF.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxFont.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxFont.h", "gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.h", "layout/generic/nsTextFrame.cpp", "layout/generic/nsTextFrame.h", "layout/mathml/nsMathMLChar.cpp", "layout/mathml/nsMathMLChar.h", "layout/mathml/nsMathMLmencloseFrame.cpp", "layout/mathml/nsMathMLmoFrame.cpp", "layout/mathml/nsMathMLmrootFrame.cpp", "widget/nsDeviceContextSpecProxy.cpp"], "git_node": "ce07f5981efe3f25ba1fb49539beb040cb69be13", "git_parents": ["3d5c71b38c0135f5cead89d8b96a577c5923e77a"], "node": "5359ab747a18205dce46b651b84fd226192c24b9", "parents": ["3d73a47c3243b8474f1aa1d59644ef858dc18f94"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2081417 - Keep whitespace text leaves that carry CSS alt text when their rendered text changes. r=Jamie\" for causing build bustages @ NotificationController.cpp\n\nThis reverts commit cfef21c3ebfc2ab6bf61a61ede64b2c10c5f7e79.\n", "files": ["accessible/base/NotificationController.cpp"], "git_node": "5c6c109a95aa88269c23d30df85e1de8c1a9c1a4", "git_parents": ["ce07f5981efe3f25ba1fb49539beb040cb69be13"], "node": "5c3ebde064bd83dd0601cc08115e4640dc523934", "parents": ["5359ab747a18205dce46b651b84fd226192c24b9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081567 - Use vector instead of deque for external image and surface queues. r=gfx-reviewers,emilio,nical\n\nFoofrix has found that deque incurs allocations in the default constructor even when it is not used,\nwhereas vector does not. So when the external image and surface queues are not used, it was incurring\nunecessary allocations and deletions. It is overall a speedup to replace these queues with a vector.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333483\n", "files": ["gfx/2d/DrawEventRecorder.h", "gfx/2d/DrawEventRecorderTypes.h", "gfx/layers/CanvasDrawEventRecorder.cpp"], "git_node": "ceadd7be15c4066d5ceb34b1c644ce5c2641f801", "git_parents": ["5c6c109a95aa88269c23d30df85e1de8c1a9c1a4"], "node": "e51cabb7e4e6b884a100dddb4d596b535dc4d35b", "parents": ["5c3ebde064bd83dd0601cc08115e4640dc523934"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Perf AI Bot \u003cperf-ai-bot@bmo.tld\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081572 - In CanvasDrawEventRecorder::GetContiguousBuffer, reset mDropBufferOnZero to mDropBufferLimit (gfx.canvas.remote.drop-buffer-limit, default 100) after each spare-buffer drop instead of resetting it to 1. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nIn CanvasDrawEventRecorder::GetContiguousBuffer, reset mDropBufferOnZero to mDropBufferLimit (gfx.canvas.remote.drop-buffer-limit, default 100) after each spare-buffer drop instead of resetting it to 1.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333484\n", "files": ["gfx/layers/CanvasDrawEventRecorder.cpp"], "git_node": "71c2ec0314b6cd7b7860ce0a82725c47d3e2dedf", "git_parents": ["ceadd7be15c4066d5ceb34b1c644ce5c2641f801"], "node": "df71d9ff4dd42f150c4c11e5fe87c318c2e6f0ca", "parents": ["e51cabb7e4e6b884a100dddb4d596b535dc4d35b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1791992128, "git_changesets": ["c5704e119658f6d8b9b18b3f8c2881e4d4e91be3", "0b6f2d015b93b103ab901faa66e16838093844d2", "d600cdbf872ac0bd73717948b05fe71436cf5808", "449af23c64e97dde189a74aa708f8525521223b4", "e94d430ea00032551b0e924be8785f145a3dd3c3", "9f68694342352e5533964937a07cdd7f8b5db25c", "d7b8e8d7ee395c771e8f154abcd2098736010b7b", "9b48d86d8ed4f54e19b50d298f355460a31ae477", "58cd067213341f72192dda27b486031be4a602ba", "c8d58d16f9b5791b05f1f0cfd28df4327ab113f3", "1c54ef408048ff89c4bfe3b0440b6f87c45b01cb", "10df05cbd9ece9a84393678cec1bf4b1336aa89a", "5329709268f84f5a2b4ff9ccd38fac483cd8ec91", "e82a0dddc4aa8e4d34c94d11af8b3091527bd94a", "97065839d5157efc32a7f69bbd0e0a431b0b8f6f", "a7ab07e4ee507a64590607e95c4dcccb1cb5ae38", "516b6f93ec5b1287a5e4247662f0e268a2aad147", "16620648ab11592dccd1513f309439d75f99c6f0", "331ce59001582e5ff8324c495bc00c340aa26cc9", "e9d47b7670ce7b8e2d906069755f20b5c7ac9464", "ed9e04a238a43ccf417d1410a6ddd663907efdd1", "568491dafb4da7bb1d564fc83d14847f6765de43", "8347bcc75b493d3d1ac36b1f326e5e05f10e4f8c", "268ef93f4a44a5489779e302f15a21f844a4af62", "eecd30d8e7e2b8b7a2d9e3815957650649c39745", "62fcf3f5411f22404d8428ba2643611c352ba7d5", "89de575fa346a585d32f68bab2b188e05d2f6cff", "8d2b3da7e72c0d2f6ceb26e56424240ec29d7f4b", "79