ndo.moz.tools"}, "45563": {"changesets": [{"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073135 - Clear all aspects of depth-stencil attachments when resolving WebGL2 framebuffer data. r=gfx-reviewers,gw\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333256\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLFramebuffer.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLFramebuffer.h"], "git_node": "a0c91cf3a291b205f72b4d91dfa48141b63ec96c", "git_parents": ["71c2ec0314b6cd7b7860ce0a82725c47d3e2dedf"], "node": "458b36f87dc51e85dbaac7c496ead650c5dc2eff", "parents": ["df71d9ff4dd42f150c4c11e5fe87c318c2e6f0ca"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Nicolas Silva \u003cnsilva@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081261 - Apply and restore every draw buffer's color mask around WebGL resource clears. r=gfx-reviewers,gw\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333257\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/WebGLContext.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLContext.h", "dom/canvas/WebGLContextFramebufferOperations.cpp", "dom/canvas/WebGLContextState.cpp"], "git_node": "8f431c7192c10a715380af8fbb250cd2f428022c", "git_parents": ["a0c91cf3a291b205f72b4d91dfa48141b63ec96c"], "node": "dcb928bd524c8d68dbd4cb5216ff3192ac2529b6", "parents": ["458b36f87dc51e85dbaac7c496ead650c5dc2eff"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Kia Salehzadeh \u003ckiasalehzadeh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2077681: Fixed crash by changing privacy.trackingprotection.annotate_channels to type RelaxedAtomicBool to allow access off main thread. r=edgar\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D331870\n", "files": ["modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "563853ea8e4beda1e0700a8734874372aac4efcd", "git_parents": ["8f431c7192c10a715380af8fbb250cd2f428022c"], "node": "3e60af0d3c89a0f08f0c8a39ccd1e6617276359a", "parents": ["dcb928bd524c8d68dbd4cb5216ff3192ac2529b6"], "tags": []}, {"author": "AndiAJ \u003candiaj@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081618 - Add the converted annotation to the legacy verifyTheTermsOfUseOnboardingCardTest UI test r=isabel_rios\n\nThe UI test was converted by @jajohnson in [[ https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D313635 | D313635 ]] back in July.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333528\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/androidTest/java/org/mozilla/fenix/ui/OnboardingTest.kt"], "git_node": "7dfaae4cec58c05e07e3af726e9859323a9d18d3", "git_parents": ["563853ea8e4beda1e0700a8734874372aac4efcd"], "node": "c299eb047397bdeacc69913d2a4608d80a4a197e", "parents": ["3e60af0d3c89a0f08f0c8a39ccd1e6617276359a"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Damien Carver \u003cdcarver@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081307 - Use a dummy env var to force a restart in the geckodriver lifecycle tests. r=webdriver-reviewers,whimboo\n\nThe tests only need extra_env to differ from the previous run, so nothing\nshould read the variable. Firefox ignores MOZ_LOG=1 today because its parser\nstops at the leading digit, but a stricter parser (bug 2080769) reports it as\nan error.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333306\n", "files": ["testing/web-platform/mozilla/tests/webdriver/harness/geckodriver_lifecycle.py"], "git_node": "3787cfb592632258dae25ad107eb2def3c6a63bc", "git_parents": ["7dfaae4cec58c05e07e3af726e9859323a9d18d3"], "node": "d1a4fc15af11c5c918408f8283fce2c0da5cb708", "parents": ["c299eb047397bdeacc69913d2a4608d80a4a197e"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080581. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333454\n", "files": ["gfx/thebes/gfxTextRun.cpp"], "git_node": "6e2c0fd5c76501c9cfa3691fef1730189ec80689", "git_parents": ["3787cfb592632258dae25ad107eb2def3c6a63bc"], "node": "419e298cbc4ca8ebc7daac5fd399e7d355d131af", "parents": ["d1a4fc15af11c5c918408f8283fce2c0da5cb708"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Lee Salzman \u003clsalzman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081590 - Combine image and solid color programs in DrawTargetWebgl. r=gfx-reviewers,nical\n\nFoofrix suggests that the costs of switching shaders between a solid color program and an\nimage program in mixed workloads leads to a much higher cost switching changes than the\nsmall instruction saving of the solid color program versus the image program can compensate\nfor.\n\nOverall, we are better off combining them into one program with a uniform branch to toggle\nsampling from the image texture. This also results in a substantial reduction in the amount\nof shader program code.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333508\n", "files": ["dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.cpp", "dom/canvas/DrawTargetWebgl.h"], "git_node": "284515e0be0f21eac78360c3bd25ba0274f900a7", "git_parents": ["6e2c0fd5c76501c9cfa3691fef1730189ec80689"], "node": "31cac0dc341574650bf5782ec6726ab1bfaba754", "parents": ["419e298cbc4ca8ebc7daac5fd399e7d355d131af"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Vincent Hilla \u003cvhilla@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080799 - Check for dirty continuation frames in GetInnerText. r=layout-reviewers,dshin,TYLin\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333160\n", "files": ["dom/html/nsGenericHTMLElement.cpp", "testing/web-platform/tests/html/dom/elements/the-innertext-and-outertext-properties/dynamic-getter.html"], "git_node": "7c710e927722a722f3bef58a72877b46d198e990", "git_parents": ["284515e0be0f21eac78360c3bd25ba0274f900a7"], "node": "5976fd475ccee630c61b8284fb965094d0d7118c", "parents": ["31cac0dc341574650bf5782ec6726ab1bfaba754"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alexandra Borovova \u003caborovova@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080587 - Revert metadata for encrypted-media/drm-keystatuses-multiple-sessions.https.html.\n\nDifferential Revision: https: