27 - Reading the hosts file blocks BgIOThreadPool shutdown inside NtReadFile on Windows r=necko-reviewers,jesup\n\n- Move to dedicated thread pool that we can shutdownWithTimeout\n- Only continue on UTF8 errors - all others should break the hosts read loop\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332913\n", "files": ["netwerk/base/rust-helper/src/lib.rs", "netwerk/dns/DNSServiceBase.cpp", "netwerk/dns/DNSServiceBase.h", "netwerk/test/gtest/TestEtcHostsParsing.cpp"], "git_node": "a3aa8b60b366947f73da01319029fc7c3b0ca667", "git_parents": ["42b66c408816b7429f93ede02d65027d457745c5"], "node": "d97b4e6185e3a893b37b9620bc34c6964d13a404", "parents": ["b4e369c1367690f81ee3ded46d8d477d085b78ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Valentin Gosu \u003cvalentin.gosu@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2079692 - Handle WebSocketChannel::OnUpgradeFailed on the main thread. r=necko-reviewers,jesup\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332515\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/websocket/WebSocketChannel.cpp"], "git_node": "b5e0496b140550be2d82768a6829814588b4828e", "git_parents": ["a3aa8b60b366947f73da01319029fc7c3b0ca667"], "node": "dbe923b071d532f89fc5311a09e49cfd040d6727", "parents": ["d97b4e6185e3a893b37b9620bc34c6964d13a404"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081241 - Resolve expandable menu items titles when used as content descriptions r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nEnsure Talkback will read the resolved text instead of the string resource id.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333513\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/ExpandableHeaderItem.kt"], "git_node": "d3c29726caa4c3230e1577e18440909bdde4733d", "git_parents": ["b5e0496b140550be2d82768a6829814588b4828e"], "node": "980947a08dfdaaa208b6696772cd5e73fd8ad03b", "parents": ["dbe923b071d532f89fc5311a09e49cfd040d6727"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081201 - Allow menu items to not be clickable r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nThis is needed for extensions actions shown as menu items in custom tab's menu.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333514\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/data/MenuItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemCommon.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridItemTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/focus-android/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/focus/menu/home/HomeMenuMiddlewareTest.kt"], "git_node": "c00728e9b936ea444b1b3d816aaf111b850a921a", "git_parents": ["d3c29726caa4c3230e1577e18440909bdde4733d"], "node": "f2e28a08b3755abe15d5d4a8851bd0fad373090a", "parents": ["980947a08dfdaaa208b6696772cd5e73fd8ad03b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081598 - Ensure switches state updates are read by talkback r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nThis brings parity with the old menu which had this updated in bug 2080131.\n\nDi