habricator.services.mozilla.com/D333517\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BackMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuHost.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemProvidersFactory.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/res/navigation/nav_graph.xml", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BackMenuItemProviderTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/MenuItemsRegistryTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/components/menu/fake/FakeMenuHost.kt"], "git_node": "2ab9f3b717d2bd3a0b09c39d65fff529dac77484", "git_parents": ["1ea659fc38e0b730b88fd1817aae9ea40176d93f"], "node": "00272df20fae8f12b03b6dd9afb73d1d60d7467f", "parents": ["0f1a0191b42887140f8d19b61075b5414c01716b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081607 - Preserve expandable items state between activity recreations r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nIf the Extensions or More items were expanded before changing the system\nthem they will remain expanded in the recreated activity.\nThis change ensures parity with the old menu UX.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333518\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/ExpandableHeaderItem.kt"], "git_node": "c179b95eb9a0c95dd86f851d7a21aed7712a65c0", "git_parents": ["2ab9f3b717d2bd3a0b09c39d65fff529dac77484"], "node": "d028149c5f4e9a1561c0a5e05b185fbf76fff4d4", "parents": ["00272df20fae8f12b03b6dd9afb73d1d60d7467f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081608 - Optimize ExpandableHeaderItem animations r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nSlow down the expand/collapse animations to 300ms, the same the old menu used.\nAvoid the edgecase in which the \"More\" item is expanded and it will initially\nbe hidden so the menu shrinks then its items are shown so the menu grows.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333519\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/ExpandableHeaderItem.kt"], "git_node": "6d4f1227e9e5ea2120c1ed3e4ebca0edf229ffef", "git_parents": ["c179b95eb9a0c95dd86f851d7a21aed7712a65c0"], "node": "4b9c05056d6c10f9589474e3e461a39f70a33e37", "parents": ["d028149c5f4e9a1561c0a5e05b185fbf76fff4d4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081609 - Update extensions UX when fetching recommendations fails r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nWhen fetching recommendations fails the Extensions row now behaves like\nin the legacy menu: it shows \"No extensions enabled\" as a plain row with\nthe settings button, and tapping it opens the extensions manager.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333520\n", "files": ["mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/test/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProviderTest.kt"], "git_node": "4b89b64e7729cf9572138533551515a146cbeb1e", "git_parents": ["6d4f1227e9e5ea2120c1ed3e4ebca0edf229ffef"], "node": "944e0ff91a7deb7e72dd9c031615ef124db1a501", "parents": ["4b9c05056d6c10f9589474e3e461a39f70a33e37"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mugurell \u003cMugurell@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081610 - Update extensions items UI r=android-reviewers,giorga\n\nTo match the legacy menu:\n- extensions' actions names will be shown on only one line\nThis required introducing MenuItemTitle which allows configuring the\nmaximum number of lines a menu item title can be shown in.\n- the \"Discover more extensions\" item will show an external-link icon\nThis required introducing a new trailingIcon parameter to StandardMenuItem.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333521\n", "files": ["mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/data/MenuItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/ExpandableHeaderItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuGridContainer.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItem.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemCommon.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemGroup.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/utils/MainSectionMenuItemsPreviewData.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/main/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/utils/MenuPreviewParameterProvider.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/MenuTest.kt", "mobile/android/android-components/components/compose/menu/src/test/java/mozilla/components/compose/menu/ui/MenuListItemTest.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/addons/ExtensionsMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/bookmarks/BookmarkMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/bookmarks/BookmarksScreenMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mozilla/fenix/browser/BackMenuItemProvider.kt", "mobile/android/fenix/app/src/main/java/org/mo