p"], "git_node": "247213176f92902f506e04f4686815ce9ba0bbd3", "git_parents": ["d1d6f5b115c1ec54c00d435a20f94943418f529a"], "node": "4df0747322d0fef44940f57673600140591d478b", "parents": ["304d7260a7df9068c0ab9f19a25001158ee01cb9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "agoloman \u003cagoloman@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2077486 - Keep nsHttpHandler::mActivityDistributor alive until the handler is destroyed. r=necko-reviewers,kershaw\" for causing dt failures.\n\nThis reverts commit ff3f633ad55001f2577ceb097116aca9f3ae99f7.\n", "files": ["netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.cpp", "netwerk/protocol/http/nsHttpHandler.h"], "git_node": "5eac64c02dde01154daa11ea38eaa544bc188812", "git_parents": ["247213176f92902f506e04f4686815ce9ba0bbd3"], "node": "079bd3a8fbce2e99a9d7c21088be8105c0d2b21c", "parents": ["4df0747322d0fef44940f57673600140591d478b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Paul Bone \u003cpbone@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2070295 - Make PHC Initialisation fallible r=glandium\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D332801\n", "files": ["memory/build/PHC.cpp"], "git_node": "0266ec5cff69f1352711a61d65c1a40037fab163", "git_parents": ["5eac64c02dde01154daa11ea38eaa544bc188812"], "node": "960a58103b5ced83b051d2cdedc00e2e00fdf8e9", "parents": ["079bd3a8fbce2e99a9d7c21088be8105c0d2b21c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Glenn Watson \u003cgit@chillybin.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2030272 - Skip vertex data texture uploads when the frame data is unchanged r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nDuring Wayland direct scanout a frame is presented every vsync for the changed\nvideo surface while WebRender draws nothing, yet bind_frame_data still created\na TextureUploader. Device::upload_texture probes the PBO pool fences with\nclient_wait_sync, which flushes the GPU command stream on AMD/Mesa.\n\nRetain a copy of the last upload and skip when the data matches. Buffers over\none texture row are always treated as dirty, bounding the copy to 64 kB. The\ntexture set ring now only rotates on upload, since the rotation exists to avoid\nwriting a texture the GPU may still be sampling.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323057\n", "files": ["gfx/wr/webrender/src/renderer/init.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/renderer/mod.rs", "gfx/wr/webrender/src/renderer/vertex.rs", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/performance/reftest.list", "gfx/wr/wrench/reftests/performance/static-scene-no-vertex-upload.yaml", "gfx/wr/wrench/src/reftest.rs"], "git_node": "38fa65ee7cc314733e8c170f79b801c31fdf7865", "git_parents": ["0266ec5cff69f1352711a61d65c1a40037fab163"], "node": "f967346959449efbc15fddafb0c5a7273a387ff9", "parents": ["960a58103b5ced83b051d2cdedc00e2e00fdf8e9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sotaro Ikeda \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081578 - Rename gfxVars::UseAImageReaderVideoGpuProcessAndroid() to gfxVars::ForceAImageReaderAndroid() r=gfx-reviewers,bradwerth\n\nChange its role as to enable AImageReader usage with native MediaCodec and check if SurfaceTextureHost is not used.\nAnd it prevents to create SurfaceTextureHost when gfxVars::ForceAImageReaderAndroid() is true.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333490\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/FFmpegVideoDecoder.cpp", "gfx/config/gfxVars.h", "gfx/gl/GLBlitHelper.cpp", "gfx/ipc/GPUParent.cpp", "gfx/layers/GLImages.cpp", "gfx/layers/opengl/TextureHostOGL.cpp", "gfx/thebes/gfxPlatform.cpp", "gfx/webrender_bindings/RenderAndroidSurfaceTextureHost.cpp", "modules/libpref/init/StaticPrefList.yaml"], "git_node": "cce290816ae6b7d795df55e5adc5c4af3810bf63", "git_parents": ["38fa65ee7cc314733e8c170f79b801c31fdf7865"], "node": "3ee8fe17cc4d8ded0f74c8a86f8cfd3a174e92d3", "parents": ["f967346959449efbc15fddafb0c5a7273a387ff9"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Taimur Hasan \u003cthasan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2072322 - Give monitor checks time to settle before reading pages r=ai-platform-reviewers,ai-security-reviewers,gregtatum,again\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D327996\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Tools.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/agents/Monitor.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/browser_monitor_agent.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/tests/browser/head.js", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/PageExtractorChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/PageExtractorParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/tests/browser/browser_headless_extractor.js"], "git_node": "9599a53b2a0cae9097e99a4d091056c1c4b39616", "git_parents": ["cce290816ae6b7d795df55e5adc5c4af3810bf63"], "node": "f61d2c0502796ae2e63f9aaf37fd8c8ab1a2d45b", "parents": ["3ee8fe17cc4d8ded0f74c8a86f8cfd3a174e92d3"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Taimur Hasan \u003cthasan@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080002 - Let headless extractor tests fire the load deadline after the navigation instead of racing it r=ai-platform-reviewers,nordzilla\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333846\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/pageextractor/PageExtractorParent.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/tests/browser/browser_headless_extractor.js", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/tests/browser/browser_page_extractor_markers.js", "toolkit/components/pageextractor/tests/browser/head.js"], "git_node": "ba3e18c15d63956479d0fbf881f8b77826c776c6", "git_parents": ["9599a53b2a0cae9097e99a4d091056c1c4b39616"], "node": "50ccce021426fe50d3e9f944d2d34fbf0214a620", "parents": ["f61d2c0502796ae2e63f9aaf37fd8c8ab1a2d45b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Timothy Nikkel \u003ctnikkel@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081262. Null check the solid color item in PresShell::AddCanvasBackgroundColorItem. r=gfx-reviewers,lsalzman\n\nMakeDisplayItem returns null when building an events-only 