The extension\narrived in the bug 2067742 Vulkan update. With it requested, RDD\nMediaSupervisor held one core at about 100% through the 30-second\nYouTube startup window.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334367\n", "files": ["media/ffvpx/README_MOZILLA", "media/ffvpx/libavutil/hwcontext_vulkan.c", "media/ffvpx/no-nv-optical-flow.patch"], "git_node": "f7a07d1d32990f262123bbc412e0f98547ba53ef", "git_parents": ["55a805b5cd01e5213abbd155e929dcad1a41f6f5"], "node": "a46736c890fd2f2ec2455470e06dc4b799ba836c", "parents": ["f3d9eebdb49ca4139050f2f3c19b402ab5c45b7b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "stransky \u003cstransky@redhat.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2073887 Don't crash on FFVPXRuntimeLinker::GetFFTFuncs() r=padenot,media-playback-reviewers\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334457\n", "files": ["dom/media/platforms/ffmpeg/ffvpx/FFVPXRuntimeLinker.cpp"], "git_node": "62215963133c398e099dff4cfcf71e8b7d3bdbd2", "git_parents": ["f7a07d1d32990f262123bbc412e0f98547ba53ef"], "node": "ba29f8d9cb9ee1d9c9162d27bbaa3b8726ef9ae4", "parents": ["a46736c890fd2f2ec2455470e06dc4b799ba836c"], "tags": []}, {"author": "D\u00e3o Gottwald \u003cdao@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2081318 - Keep the Nova address bar background unaffected by the Mica toolbar background. r=emilio,desktop-theme-reviewers,reusable-components-reviewers,mkennedy\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334413\n", "files": ["browser/extensions/newtab/content-src/styles/nova/_tokens.scss", "browser/themes/windows/browser.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/nova/tokens-figma-theme.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-platform.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/dist/tokens-shared.css", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/tokens/components/toolbar.nova.tokens.json", "toolkit/themes/shared/design-system/src/tokens/components/toolbar.tokens.json"], 