/phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D335782\n", "files": ["toolkit/components/nimbus/lib/RemoteSettingsExperimentLoader.sys.mjs", "toolkit/components/nimbus/test/unit/shutdown/test_RSEL_updateRecipes_recordTargetingContext.js", "toolkit/components/nimbus/test/unit/shutdown/xpcshell.toml"], "git_node": "88d9f3065e7c3f7ad729139dcec186d70c5b3169", "git_parents": ["48e02bab87f761ae1952dc10b5a4e674e5925b76"], "node": "b32aeb2287917e7f883acaf6d48aab91c1991bc1", "parents": ["c18abe393f3675cb17a199b9fa91e0c88011c8cb"], "tags": []}, {"author": "KS \u003ckshampur@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2080495 - Use aarch64 only macOS builds for performance testing r=aglavic,perftest-reviewers\n\nRight now we use universal macOS builds in perftests but we can probably\njust use the arm64 binary directly instead. The universal build (just a\nmerge of the arm64 and x64 builds) depends on PGO profiles from the Intel\n10.15 pool, so sometimes perf tests are queued up even though only arm64\ncode runs.\n\nThis patch points the perftests (awsy, talos, browsertime) at the arm64\nbuild. Same code and PGO profile so results should not change. This only\naffects performance tests. Presently, we already do this in the\nmozperftest framework.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D333419\n", "files": ["taskcluster/kinds/browsertime/desktop.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/test/awsy.yml", "taskcluster/kinds/test/talos.yml"], "git_node": "50bfed66263747737516b67e2938a9d18b5b9dec", "git_parents": ["88d9f3065e7c3f7ad729139dcec186d70c5b3169"], "node": "ac46d711a347b365d29f6da963f89910b73350ae", "parents": ["b32aeb2287917e7f883acaf6d48aab91c1991bc1"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Keith Cirkel \u003ckeithamus@users.noreply.github.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2051256 - Part 1: Use an enum for HTML parser sanitizer mode r=hsivonen\n\nKeep the safe/unsafe mode explicit through nsContentUtils and the string parser, converting to the tree builder's boolean at its boundary.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D334501\n", "files": ["dom/base/Document.cpp", "dom/base/nsContentUtils.cpp", "dom/base/nsContentUtils.h", "parser/html/nsHtml5StringParser.cpp", "parser/html/nsHtml5StringParser.h"], "git_node": "7615d474e965c785081ab4d4bb7c706f08926379", "git_parents": ["50bfed66263747737516b67e2938a9d18b5b9dec"], "node": "472bcd5055f14eb5b62f6013919a169487216ea1", "parents": ["ac46d711a347b365d29f6da963f89910b73350ae"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Sandor Molnar \u003csmolnar@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2079889 - Distinguish Smart Page updates from creation in the action log. r=fluent-reviewers,ngrato,gazhibekova,bolsson\" for causing lint failures\n\nThis reverts commit db3989c676eb236bca0b989c001ce13425164bd9.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2079889 - Move Smart Page creation progress into the action log. r=ngrato,fluent-reviewers,gazhibekova,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit d697c86af655193ec0fe8a0e195c98e1834c03e0.\n\nRevert \"Bug 2079889 - Update Smart Page creation wording. r=fluent-reviewers,bolsson\"\n\nThis reverts commit 338428e50d68c0f2d3ff4f4b64b398031db107a7.\n", "files": ["browser/components/aiwindow/models/Chat.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/models/Tools.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-chat-content/ai-chat-content.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/ai-window/ai-window.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-tool-ui/aitab-tool-ui.css", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-tool-ui/aitab-tool-ui.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/components/aitab-tool-ui/aitab-tool-ui.stories.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/modules/ToolActionLog.sys.mjs", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/browser/browser_aitab_tool_ui.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ChatConversation.js", "browser/components/aiwindow/ui/test/xpcshell/test_ToolActionLog.js", "browser/locales-preview/aiWindow.ftl"]